eamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/314430/extras/cf29bcd02f6d92817c4940c4063b6e14.poster.avif?t=1771619940\" width=624 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/314430/extras/cf29bcd02f6d92817c4940c4063b6e14.webm?t=1771619940\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/314430/extras/cf29bcd02f6d92817c4940c4063b6e14.mp4?t=1771619940\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Saving the world is no easy feat, but fret not! Your epic achievements and glorious accolades will be chronicled throughout fully voice-acted cutscenes and cinematics.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/314430/extras/3597b2bcb223bb94cb12e7a74b8f3537.poster.avif?t=1771619940\" width=624 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/314430/extras/3597b2bcb223bb94cb12e7a74b8f3537.webm?t=1771619940\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/314430/extras/3597b2bcb223bb94cb12e7a74b8f3537.mp4?t=1771619940\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Travel through time amidst your efforts to save the world! Fighting dinosaurs, mummies, robots and sorts of creatures from ancient history and the future... as well as some timelines that never happened!", "short_description": "MARS is a Free-To-Play Third Person Shooter set in an evolving sci-fi world. From the hilarious Headhunter mode, to Huge Mecha vs Mecha battles, to fully customizable loadouts; whether Co-op or PvP, M.A.R.S. has something for everyone. Kill, Die, Repeat.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/314430/header.jpg?t=17716